              </span>
              <h3>What Bella Vet Admin caught</h3>
            </div>
            <p>The dog had crossed senior threshold a year ago — no senior bloods on file. Recent weight chart showed a 12% drop over 6 months without a noted reason. The Atopica refill the owner had requested by phone three weeks ago hadn't been authorised. It then drafted the owner WhatsApp suggesting a 25-minute slot with bloods drawn at the same visit.</p>
