              <h3>The outcome</h3>
            </div>
            <p>Owner accepted the longer slot. Senior bloods drawn the same visit revealed early kidney indicators — diet and monitoring plan started months earlier than it would have been spotted. Atopica refill authorised. Microchip number collected and added to the file. One visit, three problems prevented.</p>
